  <data name="label8.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fabric Quality – Handwoven textiles are known for their durability and softness, achieved through meticulous weaving.
Cultural Identity – Traditional motifs and natural color palettes, infused with contemporary designs, resonate with both local and global audiences.
Customizability – The adaptability of artisans allows textiles to be produced in small or large quantities, tailored to individual needs.
Sustainability – Rooted in rural households, the handloom sector has minimal environmental impact, making it a sustainable and ethical choice.


